wcTools 10.0.500.2 - Wildcat! Sysop Tools
Command-line tools for Wildcat! v8/v10
sysops, in Python on the wcPAPI SDK.
Trace SMTP mail end to end through the
logs, audit smtpfilter rules, list mail,
files, areas, groups and user access,
replay spool messages, manage IP access.
Needs Python 3.6+; wcPAPI included.
